---
import PageLayout from "@layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import Section from "@components/sections/Section.astro";
import Badge from "@components/astro-ui/Badge.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import { site } from "@/data/site";

import weightImg from "@assets/images/site/weight-management.jpg";
import patientCareImg from "@assets/images/site/patient-care.jpg";
---

<PageLayout
  title="Weight Management"
  description="Clinically guided weight management programs tailored for sustainable results. Velora HealthConnect offers personalised telehealth consultations with ongoing follow-up care across Australia."
>
  <!-- ===== HERO ===== -->
  <section class="relative pt-16 pb-12 md:pt-24 md:pb-16 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[oklch(0.965_0.01_230)] via-white to-[oklch(0.96_0.015_175)]"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-10 right-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-[oklch(0.92_0.04_175/0.2)] rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <Badge variant="secondary" class="mb-6 bg-[oklch(0.92_0.03_175)] text-[oklch(0.30_0.06_175)]">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mr-1.5 inline-block" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 13.125C3 12.504 3.504 12 4.125 12h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v6.75C7.5 20.496 6.996 21 6.375 21h-2.25A1.125 1.125 0 013 19.875v-6.75zM9.75 8.625c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v11.25c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-2.25a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V8.625zM16.5 4.125c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25C20.496 3 21 3.504 21 4.125v15.75c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-2.25a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V4.125z" /></svg>
        Weight Management
      </Badge>
      <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-primary sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl mb-6">
        Sustainable weight loss,<br class="hidden sm:block" />
        <span class="text-accent">medically guided</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-lg text-muted-foreground md:text-xl leading-relaxed">
        Clinically supervised weight management programs designed for lasting results. Personalised treatment plans with genuine follow-up care — not just a prescription and goodbye.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== OVERVIEW ===== -->
  <Section id="overview" padding="lg">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">The Program</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary sm:text-4xl mb-6">
          A weight management approach built around you
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            At Velora HealthConnect, we understand that weight management is not one-size-fits-all. What works for one person may not work for another, and sustainable results require more than a quick consultation.
          </p>
          <p>
            Our programs are designed for adults — particularly women aged 35 and over — who have tried conventional approaches without lasting success. We combine evidence-based medical treatments with personalised care plans, regular check-ins, and ongoing adjustments to help you achieve meaningful, sustainable results.
          </p>
          <p>
            Every program is overseen by an Australian-registered prescriber who takes the time to understand your health history, lifestyle, and goals before recommending any treatment.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl">
          <Image
            src={weightImg}
            alt="Woman exercising as part of a guided weight management program"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            width={600}
            height={450}
          />
        </div>
        <!-- Floating card -->
        <div class="absolute -bottom-4 -left-4 bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-xl ring-1 ring-black/5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-heading font-bold text-primary text-sm">Ongoing Support</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Not just a prescription</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <!-- ===== WHAT'S INCLUDED ===== -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-[oklch(0.975_0.005_230/0.5)] to-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-14">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">What Is Included</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary sm:text-4xl mb-4">
          A complete weight management program
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground">
          More than just medication — a full care framework designed to support you at every stage.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 6a3.75 3.75 0 11-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 017.5 0zM4.501 20.118a7.5 7.5 0 0114.998 0A17.933 17.933 0 0112 21.75c-2.676 0-5.216-.584-7.499-1.632z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-primary mb-2">Personalised Assessment</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            A thorough initial consultation to understand your medical history, lifestyle, previous attempts, and specific goals before recommending any treatment.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.75 3.104v5.714a2.25 2.25 0 01-.659 1.591L5 14.5M9.75 3.104c-.251.023-.501.05-.75.082m.75-.082a24.301 24.301 0 014.5 0m0 0v5.714c0 .597.237 1.17.659 1.591L19.8 15.3M14.25 3.104c.251.023.501.05.75.082M19.8 15.3l-1.57.393A9.065 9.065 0 0112 15a9.065 9.065 0 00-6.23.693L5 14.5m14.8.8l1.402 1.402c1.232 1.232.65 3.318-1.067 3.611A48.309 48.309 0 0112 21c-2.773 0-5.491-.235-8.135-.687-1.718-.293-2.3-2.379-1.067-3.61L5 14.5" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-primary mb-2">Evidence-Based Treatment</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Clinically proven medications prescribed only when clinically appropriate, with dosages tailored to your individual needs and response.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-primary mb-2">Scheduled Follow-Ups</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Regular check-in appointments with your prescriber to track progress, adjust treatment, and address any side effects or concerns.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10.5 1.5H8.25A2.25 2.25 0 006 3.75v16.5a2.25 2.25 0 002.25 2.25h7.5A2.25 2.25 0 0018 20.25V3.75a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25-2.25H13.5m-3 0V3h3V1.5m-3 0h3m-3 18.75h3" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-primary mb-2">Dedicated Support Team</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            A real team available by phone and email between appointments for questions about your treatment, side effects, or general guidance.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 3v11.25A2.25 2.25 0 006 16.5h2.25M3.75 3h-1.5m1.5 0h16.5m0 0h1.5m-1.5 0v11.25A2.25 2.25 0 0118 16.5h-2.25m-7.5 0h7.5m-7.5 0l-1 3m8.5-3l1 3m0 0l.5 1.5m-.5-1.5h-9.5m0 0l-.5 1.5m.75-9l3-3 2.148 2.148A12.061 12.061 0 0116.5 7.605" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-primary mb-2">Progress Monitoring</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            We track your health outcomes over time and proactively adjust your care plan to maximise results and minimise side effects.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8.25 18.75a1.5 1.5 0 01-3 0m3 0a1.5 1.5 0 00-3 0m3 0h6m-9 0H3.375a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V14.25m17.25 4.5a1.5 1.5 0 01-3 0m3 0a1.5 1.5 0 00-3 0m3 0h1.125c.621 0 1.129-.504 1.09-1.124a17.902 17.902 0 00-3.213-9.193 2.056 2.056 0 00-1.58-.86H14.25M16.5 18.75h-2.25m0-11.177v-.958c0-.568-.422-1.048-.987-1.106a48.554 48.554 0 00-10.026 0 1.106 1.106 0 00-.987 1.106v7.635m12-6.677v6.677m0 4.5v-4.5m0 0h-12" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-primary mb-2">Home Delivery</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            If treatment is prescribed, your medication is dispensed by a licensed Australian pharmacy and delivered discreetly to your door.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== WHO IS IT FOR ===== -->
  <Section id="who" padding="lg">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <div class="order-2 lg:order-1 space-y-8">
        <div class="aspect-[16/9] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl">
          <Image
            src={patientCareImg}
            alt="Friendly healthcare professional providing trusted patient care"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top"
            width={600}
            height={338}
          />
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border-2 border-accent/20 p-8 bg-accent/[0.03]">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-6">You may be a good candidate if:</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-4">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              <span class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">You have a BMI over 30 (or over 27 with weight-related health conditions)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              <span class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Diet and exercise alone have not delivered lasting results</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              <span class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">You are looking for a medically supervised approach with proper support</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              <span class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">You want ongoing follow-up and monitoring, not just a one-off script</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              <span class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">You are an adult aged 18+ based in Australia</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="order-1 lg:order-2">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Who Is This For</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary sm:text-4xl mb-6">
          Designed for people who want more than a quick fix
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Our weight management program is designed for adults who are ready to take a medically guided approach to sustainable weight loss. We focus on long-term outcomes, not rapid weight loss that does not last.
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          Not everyone is clinically suitable for medication-assisted weight management. During your consultation, your prescriber will conduct a thorough assessment and only recommend treatment if it is appropriate for your individual circumstances.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <!-- ===== HOW IT WORKS ===== -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-[oklch(0.975_0.005_230/0.5)] to-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-14">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">The Process</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary sm:text-4xl mb-4">
          How it works
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground">
          From your first enquiry through to ongoing care — four straightforward steps.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 lg:gap-0">
        <div class="relative text-center lg:px-6">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-white border-2 border-accent/20 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5 shadow-sm relative z-10">
            <span class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-accent">1</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-primary mb-2">Submit Your Enquiry</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Complete a brief online form about your health goals, weight history, and any current medications.
          </p>
          <div class="hidden lg:block absolute top-8 left-[calc(50%+2.5rem)] w-[calc(100%-5rem)] h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-accent/30 via-accent/15 to-accent/30"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative text-center lg:px-6">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-white border-2 border-accent/20 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5 shadow-sm relative z-10">
            <span class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-accent">2</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-primary mb-2">Doctor Consultation</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Meet with an Australian-registered prescriber via telehealth to discuss your goals and assess suitability.
          </p>
          <div class="hidden lg:block absolute top-8 left-[calc(50%+2.5rem)] w-[calc(100%-5rem)] h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-accent/30 via-accent/15 to-accent/30"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative text-center lg:px-6">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-white border-2 border-accent/20 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5 shadow-sm relative z-10">
            <span class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-accent">3</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-primary mb-2">Start Treatment</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            If approved, your medication is dispensed and delivered. We guide you through everything to start safely.
          </p>
          <div class="hidden lg:block absolute top-8 left-[calc(50%+2.5rem)] w-[calc(100%-5rem)] h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-accent/30 via-accent/15 to-accent/30"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative text-center lg:px-6">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-accent flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5 shadow-lg shadow-accent/20 relative z-10">
            <span class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-white">4</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-primary mb-2">Ongoing Follow-Up</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Regular check-ins, dosage adjustments, and dedicated support throughout your weight loss journey.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== FAQ ===== -->
  <Section id="faq" padding="lg">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">FAQs</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary sm:text-4xl mb-4">
          Weight management questions
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border overflow-hidden hover:border-accent/20 transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer list-none">
            <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-primary pr-4">What medications do you prescribe for weight management?</h3>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-muted-foreground flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" /></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            We prescribe TGA-approved medications for weight management based on individual clinical assessment. The specific medication recommended will depend on your medical history, current health conditions, and treatment goals. Your prescriber will explain all options, risks, and expected outcomes during your consultation.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border overflow-hidden hover:border-accent/20 transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer list-none">
            <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-primary pr-4">How quickly can I expect to see results?</h3>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-muted-foreground flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" /></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Results vary between individuals. Most patients begin to notice changes within the first few weeks, but sustainable weight loss is a gradual process. We focus on safe, steady progress rather than rapid loss that does not last. Your prescriber will set realistic expectations during your initial consultation.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border overflow-hidden hover:border-accent/20 transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer list-none">
            <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-primary pr-4">Are there side effects?</h3>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-muted-foreground flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" /></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            As with any medication, side effects are possible. Common side effects will be discussed in detail during your consultation. This is one of the reasons ongoing follow-up is so important — your prescriber monitors your response and can adjust treatment to minimise any discomfort.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border overflow-hidden hover:border-accent/20 transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer list-none">
            <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-primary pr-4">Do I need to follow a diet while on treatment?</h3>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-muted-foreground flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" /></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
